@baseUrl = https://localhost:5250

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Search symbols
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/symbols/search?q=Apple

### Get daily candles (default interval=OneDay, range=SixMonths)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/candles/AAPL

### Get candles with explicit interval/range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/candles/AAPL?interval=OneDay&range=OneMonth

### Get intraday candles (exercises the Yahoo lookback clamp)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/candles/AAPL?interval=FiveMinutes&range=FiveDays

### Invalid symbol (expect 404, MarketDataErrorType.SymbolNotFound)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/candles/ZZZZINVALIDXYZ

### Invalid interval (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/candles/AAPL?interval=NotARealInterval

###
